Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:07.46,Newman-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(960,1040)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.60,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,正如大家所知 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.60,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So, as you guys know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:28.28,Newman-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(962.667,901.333)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.72,0:00:13.36,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,美国政府最近公布了爱泼斯坦的文件 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.72,0:00:13.36,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,the government of the United States released the Epstein files recently.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.22,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,其中大部分内容都被涂改得面目全非 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.22,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Most of them were redacted into oblivion,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,甚至完全空白 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,if not entirely blank.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.86,0:00:21.40,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但有一份爱泼斯坦的文件特别引起了我的注意 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.86,0:00:21.40,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,But there is one Epstein file specifically that caught my eye.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.72,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,那是一张东芝笔记本电脑底部的照片 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.72,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,It's a picture of the underside of a Toshiba laptop.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.22,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 与其他所有不重要的东西不同 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.22,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Luckily, unlike all the other unimportant stuff,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.34,0:00:33.14,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这份文件完全没有被涂改 上面有一个勉强能辨认的Windows 7产品密钥 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.34,0:00:33.14,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,this file is entirely unredacted and there is a Windows 7 product key barely discernible.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.04,0:00:37.08,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,那么 我们能用爱泼斯坦的笔记本电脑激活Windows吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.04,0:00:37.08,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So, can we activate Windows using Epstein's laptop?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.52,0:00:42.42,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,无论是Windows 10还是Windows 11 都无法再直接用Windows 7的密钥激活了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.52,0:00:42.42,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Neither Windows 10 nor Windows 11 can be directly activated with the Windows 7 key anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.14,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,微软已经禁用了这个功能 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.14,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Microsoft disabled that capability.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.44,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但是 我们能使用那个密钥激活Windows 7吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.44,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,However, can we activate Windows 7 with that key?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.92,0:00:49.92,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,让我们来一探究竟 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.92,0:00:49.92,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.76,0:00:53.88,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,为此 我们需要启动一个Windows 7虚拟机 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.76,0:00:53.88,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,For that purpose, we will need to spin up a Windows 7 VM.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.54,0:00:58.66,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这是一个Windows 7家庭高级版的官方证书类型产品密钥 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.54,0:00:58.66,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,This is a certificate of authority type of product key for Windows 7 Home Premium.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.56,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,所以 为了确保无误 我会获取Windows 7家庭高级版的ISO镜像 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.56,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So, to be sure, I'll get the Windows 7 Home Premium ISO.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.42,0:01:04.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,而且我必须提一下 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.42,0:01:04.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,And I just have to mention,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.66,0:01:07.82,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这台笔记本电脑在2010年代初其实相当不错 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.66,0:01:07.82,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,this laptop isn't bad at all for the beginning of 2010s.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.52,0:01:11.36,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,它是一台东芝Satellite L635 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.52,0:01:11.36,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,It's a Toshiba Satellite L635.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,他能拥有这样的设备真是令人惊讶 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Crazy the fact he got to own such a device.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.14,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,那时候他不是在监狱里吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.14,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he in prison by that point?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.54,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过无论如何 让我们在虚拟机上安装Windows 7家庭高级版 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.54,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,But anyways, let's install Windows 7 Home Premium on a virtual machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.16,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这是我人生中第一次 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.16,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,This is the first time,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.28,0:01:24.46,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,也可能是最后一次 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.28,0:01:24.46,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,and potentially the last time in my lifetime,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.44,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,在一台机器上安装Windows家庭高级版 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.44,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,I'm actually installing Windows Home Premium on a machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.78,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,因为它功能太少了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.78,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Because it just lacks features.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.76,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我记得好像没有组策略编辑器之类的 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.76,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,I think there's no GPEdit or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.12,0:01:33.96,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,凭记忆来说 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.12,0:01:33.96,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Off the top of my head,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.04,0:01:35.40,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,可能也没有远程桌面功能 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.04,0:01:35.40,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,maybe there is no RDP either.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.04,0:01:38.78,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,安装家庭高级版实在没什么意义 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.04,0:01:38.78,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,It just makes no sense to install Home Premium.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.16,0:01:39.90,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,直接装旗舰版不就好了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.16,0:01:39.90,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Just get Ultimate.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.68,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过我怀疑爱泼斯坦根本不会去折腾他Windows 7笔记本上的组策略
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.68,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,But I doubt Epstein would care to tweak the group policy on his Windows 7 laptop,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.02,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.02,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.70,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,他连组策略是什么都不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.70,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't even know what a group policy is.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.04,0:01:49.40,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这该死的PDF文件
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.04,0:01:49.40,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Stupid-ass pdf file.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.28,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,好吧 这时候Windows 7已经装好了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.28,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Okay, by that point Windows 7 was installed,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.58,0:01:54.44,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我在产品密钥上费了点劲
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.58,0:01:54.44,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,and I struggled a bit with the product key.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.12,0:01:58.86,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,模糊的拍摄画质让密钥边缘都快看不清了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.12,0:01:58.86,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,It's like on the edge of being redacted by the poor camera quality.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.28,0:02:00.78,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但试了几次之后
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.28,0:02:00.78,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,But after a couple attempts,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.96,0:02:01.56,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我还是成功输入了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.96,0:02:01.56,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.02,0:02:02.92,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.02,0:02:02.92,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,And what do you think,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.46,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这会是有效的Windows 7密钥吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.46,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,it's a valid Windows 7 key?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.16,0:02:05.60,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.16,0:02:05.60,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.10,0:02:07.78,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过拿到有效密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.10,0:02:07.78,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Having a valid key on our hands,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.84,0:02:09.80,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,只是万里长征第一步
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.84,0:02:09.80,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,though, is only part of the ordeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.38,0:02:16.42,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我们需要在微软后端服务器激活它密钥才能被判定为有效正版
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.38,0:02:16.42,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,We need to activate it on the Microsoft backend servers for the key to count as valid and genuine.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.38,0:02:18.90,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这是个格式正确的密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.38,0:02:18.90,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,It's a key with a valid format,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.28,0:02:23.56,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但能否在后端成功激活系统还有待验证
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.28,0:02:23.56,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,and we're yet to find out if it's actually going to activate our install on the backend.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.14,0:02:27.36,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,现在显示着产品ID和激活通知
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.14,0:02:27.36,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So here is the product ID and the activation notification.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.00,0:02:28.82,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,开始激活吧
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.00,0:02:28.82,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Let's run it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.26,0:02:31.22,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我们立刻遇到了错误 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.26,0:02:31.22,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,We're immediately faced with an error.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.80,0:02:35.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,您输入的Windows 7家庭高级版产品密钥无法用于激活 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.80,0:02:35.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,The Windows 7 Home Premium product key you typed is invalid for activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.44,0:02:39.88,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过我在往期视频里解释过 这并非绝境 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.44,0:02:39.88,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,However, I've already explained in the past videos it's not a dead end.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.50,0:02:43.20,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,微软的激活机制相当复杂 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.50,0:02:43.20,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,The Microsoft activation mechanism is quite complex.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.50,0:02:48.90,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这个密钥之所以被判定无效 是因为Windows试图通过内网自动激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.50,0:02:48.90,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs41}The reason this key is considered invalid is because Windows tries to activate it automatically via the intranet,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.44,0:02:54.18,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,而失败的原因在于每个COA密钥仅有一次通过内网直接激活的机会 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.44,0:02:54.18,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,and it fails because there is only one chance per COA key for direct intranet activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:54.93,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1257.334,907.667)}COA（Certificate of Authenticity）密钥，也就是那个笔记本下面的密钥贴纸
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.06,0:02:59.06,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过通过电话激活Windows 还能获得多次额外的机会 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.06,0:02:59.06,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,However, you can have multiple extra chances activating Windows with a phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.76,0:03:05.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs65}在密钥被列入黑名单之前可以进行5到10次电话激活 之后便无法再使用该密钥激活系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.76,0:03:05.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs41}5 to 10 times you can do that before the key gets blacklisted and you can't activate the install with it anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.60,0:03:13.08,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我们无法享受内网直接激活的原因是杰弗里·爱泼斯坦本人
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.60,0:03:13.08,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\fs40}Basically, the reason we can't enjoy direct intranet activation is because Jeffrey Epstein himself used that activation
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.18,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,过去曾用这个密钥激活过他的Windows系统
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.18,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,key in the past to activate his Windows install.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.64,0:03:20.19,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但凭借我们对Windows激活机制的了解 我们依然可以使用这个密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.64,0:03:20.19,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,But thanks to our knowledge of the Windows activation mechanism we can use that key regardless.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.74,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,如果你动作够快 你或许也能在爱泼斯坦密钥被列入黑名单前使用它
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.74,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,If you're fast enough,you can probably use the Epstein key as well before it gets blacklisted
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.74,0:03:27.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,因为尝试电话激活的人实在太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.74,0:03:27.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,because too many people tried to activate that key via phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.76,0:03:30.46,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,看来这意味着我又得打国际长途了 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.76,0:03:30.46,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So surely that means I have to call overseas again.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.08,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不 现在已经不是这样了 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.08,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Nope, that's not a thing anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.68,0:03:38.44,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,微软已于2025年12月20日关闭电话激活中心 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.68,0:03:38.44,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Microsoft has retired the call activation centers on December 20th of 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我制作的所有关于电话激活的视频都已成历史 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,All the videos I've made about phone activation are now history.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.28,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,确实有种超现实的感觉 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.28,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,That feels kind of surreal.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.32,0:03:48.50,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们现在都得使用在线激活门户了 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.32,0:03:48.50,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Either way, we have to use the online activation portal now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.90,0:03:51.28,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,电话激活的理念依然未变
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.90,0:03:51.28,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,The idea of phone activation remains the same,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,只是现在能为微软节省更多成本
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,it just costs Microsoft less money now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.04,0:03:57.72,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但如今没有内网连接就无法激活微软产品
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.04,0:03:57.72,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,And you can't activate Microsoft products without an intranet connection anymore,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.88,0:03:58.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这确实令人遗憾
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.88,0:03:58.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,which sucks.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.74,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 这次激活成功了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.74,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it was a success.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.14,0:04:05.08,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,不过有趣的是 爱泼斯坦密钥被识别为Microsoft Office 2010的密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.14,0:04:05.08,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,However, the Epstein key was labeled as a key for Microsoft Office 2010,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这确实很有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,which is really funny,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:09.44,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,但我仍想制作视频解释这种现象的成因
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.72,0:04:09.44,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,but I still want to make a video explaining why that happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.36,0:04:14.40,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,现在让我们将确认ID填入对应框格 完成这次激活
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.36,0:04:14.40,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Let's input the confirmation ID into the boxes and get this puppy activated.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.68,0:04:19.20,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.68,0:04:19.20,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.52,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,激活已成功完成
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.52,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,The activation was successful.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.26,0:04:24.68,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这无疑证实了爱泼斯坦的笔记本电脑
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.26,0:04:24.68,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,So this definitely proves the Epstein's laptop has been set up,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.04,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,曾被激活并至少使用过一次
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.04,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,activated and used at least once.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.08,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,这最终意味着什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.08,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,What does it ultimately mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.70,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,我尚不明确 但实验数据已给出证明
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.70,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but that's been experimentally proven just now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.42,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,Purple Place的冲击力从未如此强烈
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.42,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Purple Place has never hit that hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.42,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,那么 本次内容就到这里
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.42,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I think that's it for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.78,0:04:38.58,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,感谢您的观看
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.78,0:04:38.58,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.90,0:04:39.98,Newman2-CN-1080,,0,0,0,,祝您拥有美好的一天
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.90,0:04:39.98,Newman2-EN-1080,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a great day.
